Z||000000||FieroMaster88||12-04-2000||10:03 PM||||Ok, I am getting new tires for my 88 coupe (bright red paint) and was wondering wether to get the raised white letters or just black??? The sizes I am getting are 205/60/14 in the front  225/60/14 in the rear.  I just cant decide what style to get, black or white letters!!! PLEASE HELP!||||reg||5
