Z||000003||Fformula88||12-04-2000||11:45 PM||||Hmmm, are they a brand name tire?  I think raised letter tires look great on Fiero's.  So as long as they aren't some no-name tire, go with them!  I am sure they will look great on your red Fiero.  I miss the White outline letter tires that were on my Formula!  <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">  <BR>1988 Fiero Formula||||reg||1
