Z||000007||FieroLisa||12-05-2000||11:05 AM||||I'd definitely go for the white letter. I have 14 inch firestone firehawks on the coupe and love them! Pics on my website.<P>Lisa||||reg||1
Z||000008||kslish||12-05-2000||06:00 PM||||Bright red coupes and raised white letter tires just go together, especially with the 14" aluminium rims.  Definately prefer blackwalls on GT's though.  <P>Here is my '86 SC about four years ago before I did anything to it: (note the white lettered tires)<P> <IMG SRC="http://westpennfiero.onestop.net/kslish86.jpg">        <P>And at the Columbus FOCOA show in '99:<P> <IMG SRC="http://westpennfiero.onestop.net/FOCOA1.jpg">     <P>(changed to '88 Formula facias and 14" aluminium wheels but stayed with the white lettered tires)<P>Ken S.<BR>'86 SC and '87 GT<P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by kslish (edited 12-06-2000).]||||reg||1
